curl -G --data-urlencode "text_content=Did you guys see the video of that dude who was at the gym who took his earbuds and just smacked them against the wall because they would not stay in his ear during his set? I feel that man's pain on a personal level. I can't keep earbuds in my ear to save my life, especially earbuds. I have four pairs of them and I hate all of them cuz they all fucking suck. That's why I got these instead. These are the Lenovo Eraser X15 Pros. They are the best over-the-ear earbud that I've ever had. Now, I don't really like calling them buds cuz they're not like actual buds that go inside your ear. They they look just like this. They just kind of rest right over the top of your ear, just like that. And the cool part is, no matter what you're doing, they're not going to fall off your head. So if you like to go to the gym all the time, you won't have to worry about them falling out during any of your sets. And they're waterproof, so you don't have to worry about sweat. You can literally go swimming or take a shower in these. They're on sale right now for like $25 on Tik Tok, but with the right coupons, you can get them for like 10 bucks." "http://localhost:8080/tts" --output test.wav